---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Heart, MapPin, Star } from 'lucide-react';
const BASE = "";
---

<Layout title="About - AnimeFocus" description="About Alex">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto pt-12 px-6 animate-fade-in">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gray-200 mx-auto mb-6 overflow-hidden relative group">
         <img src="/images/horeki_propic.jpg" alt="Avatar" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Hi, I'm Jo.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 font-medium">Anime Enthusiast & Improvised Writer</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray mx-auto mb-8">
      <p>
    Welcome to <strong>AnimeFocus</strong>.
    <br><br>
    I created this space because I realized I love talking about every aspect of anime, diving deep and exploring every detail.
    <br><br>
    My journey started back in the <em>ancient</em> times of 2015 with the classics and cult hits. But after a year I stumbled upon what would become the bane of my existence: <strong>seasonals</strong>.
    <br><br>
    I started following every show of every season (no matter how questionable), which is how I truly refined my taste. Unfortunately, I eventually became an adult. With life getting busier, I’ve had to become picky, so now I only stick to the shows that really catch my eye.
    <br><br>
    Hope you'll enjoy the stay!
</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center text-red-500 mb-3"><Heart size={24} /></div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Passion</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Anime since 2015</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center text-gray-900 mb-3"><MapPin size={24} /></div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Base</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Sicily, IT</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center text-yellow-500 mb-3"><Star size={24} /></div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Genre</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Romance / Fantasy</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top 3 Anime (CORRETTO: class invece di className) -->
    <div class="border-t border-gray-300 pt-8 text-center">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-6">My All-Time Top 3</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        {['Toradora', 'Gurren Lagann', 'Haikyuu'].map(anime => (
          <span class="bg-black text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">
            {anime}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href={`${BASE}/`} class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 hover:text-black transition-colors">
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>